                            <comment id="16876990" author="dmekhanikov" created="Tue, 2 Jul 2019 13:53:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt; I looked through your changes. The approach looks valid&#160;to me. Please proceed&#160;with the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16879311" author="ignitetcbot" created="Fri, 5 Jul 2019 14:13:26 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
