                            <comment id="16879313" author="pavlukhin" created="Fri, 5 Jul 2019 14:15:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dmekhanikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dmekhanikov&quot;&gt;dmekhanikov&lt;/a&gt;, I prepared a patch and run tests. Could you review?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16881229" author="rkondakov" created="Tue, 9 Jul 2019 13:43:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt;, patch looks good for me except two minors:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Todo on &lt;tt&gt;IncompleteDeserializationException.java:22&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Misspelling in &quot;registration&quot; word &lt;tt&gt;StartRoutineDiscoveryMessage.java:34&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16881874" author="jooger" created="Wed, 10 Jul 2019 09:11:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pull request looks good. Just two additional minors:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) IncompleteDeserializationExceptionTest - commented code at the end&lt;br/&gt;
 2) ContinuousQueryRemoteFilterMissingInClassPathSelfTest#testServerMissingClassFailsRegistration method - doesn&apos;t check that exception not thrown.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16881891" author="pavlukhin" created="Wed, 10 Jul 2019 09:36:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rkondakov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rkondakov&quot;&gt;rkondakov&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jooger&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jooger&quot;&gt;jooger&lt;/a&gt;, thank you for review I fixed all points except&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt; 1) IncompleteDeserializationExceptionTest - commented code at the end&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I would prefer to keep commented lines because they explains how a file with serialized object is generated. Unfortunately it is not possible to uncomment them because test will not work as expected (class should not be available at runtime).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16881901" author="pavlukhin" created="Wed, 10 Jul 2019 09:50:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
